    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f02b57eb188cc40d9741e2af",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "保持尊贵。保持清廉。\n那既是铭刻在我灵魂中的命运――\n也是使命。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0524c901c7fd2404bddf4b326d540deda5fdc5a6cbf318bff7b54740827340b",
