    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f71772f2f4ac08e3e7b64b51",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "血脉……原来如此。\n思考『传承』时，这的确是\n最简单也最经典的角度。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1849efa17b828191c6d4a7d76b0c45a50eb9f86e39dcdf8c7600fa312854b97",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
