    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:472cc2dce17f9463da3303c5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c61a4cf8d8ec174c1df7839240d1a74a42c1527d0e4fdd3c5b57e25234d0d85",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111206.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        40,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/40/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:436093c63ed209a3bf985bb0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我和空中救世主一同，屏住了呼吸。\n出于性质使然，特雷森学园里\n本就有许多出身上流家庭的学生――",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e2b1634687ea2fe83901c5e3476499dcb1a0dd01e3d53545f5d52d934b3c741",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111206.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        41,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/41/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:511e09e1d87af87e63d44fcc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "可即便在其中，她也堪称超乎常规。\n因为美妙姿势，拥有与某国王族相连的血脉……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ab116d36c7d3deb320153ad6ab59c4b74d8e55462e5af47302aaacf14afd4ca",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111206.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        42,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/42/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b20fd2a9f38f951be97ac6d5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她又始终，轻盈地背负着，\n比任何人都更庞大沉重的期待――",
      "source_fingerprint": "70c29bf3543d642ed53bde01f88408b6c8565007329cee63c066fcaf1244bdef",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111206.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        43,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/43/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d8d16c2ad88f44cfd85fe12",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "美妙姿势那无比高洁的精神，\n让她一路飞奔登上了不败女王之位。",
      "source_fingerprint": "310fc3b9bb3f79a7225c04ee72ae80a9dfabbdb2223f2a05ce9baaaf59ca205f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111206.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        44,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/44/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91997d4fa43162fef684be49",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "美妙姿势",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1cb551351a68022b5153ce22910be53e5784043168e94eb897bec2ce3a0afb0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111206.json",
      "json_path": [
