    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6d174e9c67a83a17ca699eb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "空中救世主",
      "source_fingerprint": "44b0b4536a8618f87e6f59f3e688bdf6df0281db1545eb55578e92f69875751b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111206.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb3e6a0a37fbe78512570bd0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我，和母亲大人正是如此。\n在赛马娘母女之间相连的血脉――",
      "source_fingerprint": "59a5c928cecd68a196717a9c77ccf081e117ddb760f0325c9e6af450aa36639f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111206.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f27551f13a8acaebb20aeee",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "城堡的确已经令人震撼，\n可这里同样带来了相当沉重的压力……\n我们在庄严气息中跟随引导，走进宅邸。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3df10e8e9e257c37f38ad7fd9bace869ff30bfdce13ad3c26d167f30e6956c65",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111206.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        50,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/50/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22627cc14a91038fed42d98b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "没错……说到『血』。\n美妙姿势为我们介绍的正是――",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a1e5fb61fe902b8d7b0217cf3cf25ab8815d9a8b4b9ef89678b1080fcaa9c84",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111206.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        51,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/51/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7d8f3f030eb23c0ee5590fa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "第一红宝石",
