    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b75d67828dcff034d94ca426",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“华丽一族”，让伟大先祖传下的血脉――\n让其中的意志绽放光辉，\n由此建立起一段历史。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4fb7ddb58d371efb44af8b76a7c5c817573c26bfae028d086c9986167bfb8f3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111206.json",
      "json_path": [
