    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9902fbb014879f23328d558",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "正因如此。\n流淌在我身上的血，铭刻着那段历史的重量。\n传承传统的骄傲，也确实铭刻其中。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d11dd9f85c2c61020be3dcfad42df1ed9d59d15a8116ef6e704b7c784a71b61e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
