      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "传统……这，正是\n红宝石前辈所继承的强大――",
      "source_fingerprint": "132c1012996415f0e0a1c61fa8698887405afb5d43b6c1bb23ff5571844014b9",
