      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而第一红宝石，让它以\n『速度』的形式绽放光辉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "020659ac5fbc202391a1bfe157882aa522d13d8fad8fdc69ada6ed5abea7f763",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
