    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3e1a5d28c5ffab30a752356",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她在『安田纪念』、『短途马锦标』中夺冠，\n在短距离路线上留下压倒性的战绩\n自身的历史足以说明这一切……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc09accd1db799c88ff8b04eaa20ce6e5b5c603f6653c73b1dae97221b7ac5ff",
